{"id":"owmw3vt96d59i9l7gi2m4s5b6","title":"洗手的正确方法","originalTitle":null,"summary":"美国农业部研究发现，大多数消费者洗手时间不足20秒，导致细菌清除不彻底。正确洗手步骤包括湿润双手、涂抹肥皂、搓手至少20秒、冲洗和擦干。另一项研究指出，49%的毛巾上存在大肠杆菌和金黄色葡萄球菌，强调使用干净毛巾的重要性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=39731&do=blog&id=1561740"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T08:48:04.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T13:47:34.798Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T13:47:34.798Z","category":"clinical","tags":["研究成果"],"score":16,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b8f7f5f4-86aa-4755-99cf-27be09a4f09b","title":"美国农业部与另一研究揭示洗手不足及毛巾污染问题"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b8f7f5f4-86aa-4755-99cf-27be09a4f09b","title":"美国农业部与另一研究揭示洗手不足及毛巾污染问题"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fImwWG1VlHdI","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}